[{"id":2557538319,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6YcPAP","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected with the modified MRP from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101494.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [perf_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18446022/perf_2.zip)\r\n\r\nThis is the same MRP but with SphereMesh replaced by QuadMesh, so that we benchmark the animation performance and not the GPU's ability to render lots of vertices. (I also tried PointMesh but it was much slower within the editor for some reason, even though it was faster in the running project.)\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing a Linux optimized editor binary and having the editor open in front of all the moving quads, with all of them being in view. I'm using the FPS readout from `--print-fps`, as the editor indicates 1,000+ FPS which is clearly not true (it's only calculating from the render CPU/GPU time, but here we're CPU-bottlenecked by animation code).\r\n\r\nBefore | After *(this PR)*\r\n-|-\r\n57 FPS (17.54 mspf) | 76 FPS (13.16 mspf)","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101608#pullrequestreview-2557538319","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101608","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101608#pullrequestreview-2557538319"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101608"}},"submitted_at":"2025-01-16T22:27:54Z","commit_id":"8207ca01b558ba2269ea5a45dd626242d77cb808"},{"id":2560232570,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Ymgx6","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?u=e44a465cbebabb9ea2be80b59e6dc07966bef5b7&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101608#pullrequestreview-2560232570","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godoteng